# Link share card (sandbox demo). Card x 800..1120, centred. Check in each look.
setup qrencode -o /tmp/qr.png https://example.org || magick -size 200x200 xc:white /tmp/qr.png
rec ln-enter 0.5 ipc linkshare demo ready /tmp/qr.png
note Fade plus scale 0.96 -> 1 in 300 ms OutCubic; the code is crisp (no smoothing); compare QML vs Rust.
wait 1
shot ln-ready
note Card with the QR code (sharp pixels, not blurred) and the Stop Sharing button.
ipc linkshare demo busy /tmp/qr.png
wait 1
shot ln-busy
note "Sending... 40%" in the label colour and the button "Stop Sharing".
ipc linkshare demo loading x
wait 1
shot ln-loading
note A spinner turning once per 0.8 s (compare two shots a moment apart if possible).
ipc linkshare demo error x
wait 1
shot ln-error
note Red "Making the code needs qrencode." and an "Install qrencode" chip (do NOT click it: it installs).
ipc linkshare demo ready /tmp/qr.png
wait 1
ptr move 960 700 sleep 200 down
shot ln-press
note Button pressed: 0.97 scale in 100 ms (rec equivalent not possible with a held step). NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness. (Button y approximate: take from ln-ready.)
ptr move 960 700 up
wait 1
shot ln-after-press
note After release the card closes.
ipc linkshare demo ready /tmp/qr.png
wait 1
ptr move 960 540 click
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot ln-esc
note After clicking the card body, Escape closes it.
# MANUAL: A phone scanning the code is not testable here
